Smart Outdoor Garbage Monitoring and Collection Alert System
Project Overview

This project aims to develop an IoT-based smart garbage monitoring system that detects the garbage level inside a dustbin using a waterproof ultrasonic sensor and an ESP32 microcontroller.

When the garbage reaches the predefined threshold, the system activates an alert to indicate that the bin needs to be emptied.

Objectives
Monitor garbage fill levels automatically.
Detect when the dustbin is nearly full.
Provide alerts using LEDs and a buzzer.
Support remote monitoring through Wi-Fi.
Store garbage-level readings for future analysis.
