Working Principle
The ultrasonic sensor measures the distance between the sensor and the garbage surface.
The ESP32 calculates the garbage fill percentage.
The green LED indicates normal capacity.
When the bin reaches the predefined threshold, the red LED and buzzer are activated.
Wi-Fi can be used to send readings to a remote monitoring platform.
